        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/337522b8331ad754fdf46d0c4d941a6c.avif?t=1761910230\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Testimonium is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (15 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for FREE or donated to on Itch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one escapes Hell. <strong>Not truly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.poster.avif?t=1761910230\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.webm?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.mp4?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought it was just another Jehovah’s Witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he opened the door, there was no one. Just a package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside: a VHS tape. No label. Just a symbol burned into the plastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He played it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/b628c5d0685469c27cddb22164dd978b.avif?t=1761910230\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimonium is a short analog horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside the tape — a rusted iron maiden, blood-soaked rituals, rooms bound to sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. Only the loop. Only the delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in a shitty apartment ends in a place far below — again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy 90s Art Direction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Atmosphere.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Minutes of Gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/337522b8331ad754fdf46d0c4d941a6c.avif?t=1761910230\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Testimonium is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (15 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for FREE or donated to on Itch.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one escapes Hell. <strong>Not truly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.poster.avif?t=1761910230\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.webm?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/e7734abad7b37cb3536fcaaa978ef8eb.mp4?t=1761910230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought it was just another Jehovah’s Witness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he opened the door, there was no one. Just a package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside: a VHS tape. No label. Just a symbol burned into the plastic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He played it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953690/extras/b628c5d0685469c27cddb22164dd978b.avif?t=1761910230\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimonium is a short analog horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside the tape — a rusted iron maiden, blood-soaked rituals, rooms bound to sin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape. Only the loop. Only the delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in a shitty apartment ends in a place far below — again and again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy 90s Art Direction.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling Atmosphere.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 Minutes of Gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Testimonium is a bite-sized, experimental analog horror game designed to push your psychological limits. PLAY THE TAPE.",
